# OpenCOOP

OpenCode plugin for team collaboration via shared MCP server.

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install
npm install -g @opencoop/opencode-plugin

# Add to opencode.json
# {
#   "plugin": ["@opencoop/opencode-plugin"]
# }

# Restart OpenCode
# Open http://localhost:31313
```

